## Scope
- Cuts only buffered slow phase final-driver output pins into same-row PD q1 sampler D pins.
- Does not cut q1->q2, q1/q2->hit_latched, nfast_tag->timestamp, slow Johnson, clk_sys, reset/recovery, or phase-buffer topology paths.
- This is a measurement classification exception, not final signoff.
